※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4414 LANG_MATCH_NOT_EXHAUSTIVE

※ A value holds one of the alternatives, so a match that left one out would be
※ a program with nowhere to go when the value held it.

let hundred: mut u8 = 100u8
let seven: mut u8 = 7u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    match hundred ÷ seven:
        u8(q):
            return q
